{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國遊戲發行商EA（Electronic Arts）宣佈新一輪業務重組計劃，公司將裁減約400個工作崗位，約佔全球員工總數的3%。這一調整不僅涉及此前備受關注的BioWare關閉事件，還波及《模擬人生》《Skate》等多個知名遊戲項目。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583268.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.193573+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:36:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"edf1fd33828161e5d1966e2e34c43fef80c974a15ffa74f167d3bbeaefe0ab1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}